{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/111163","id":2881601404,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6rwb98","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111163","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111163.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111163.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111163","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/111163/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/111163/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111163/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/8c5e67a514ac8e5c80f6a1a28024a0ccfec92466","number":111163,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Speed up `Node::is_greater_than` by avoiding `alloca`","user":{"login":"HolonProduction","id":99511741,"node_id":"U_kgDOBe5tvQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/99511741?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction","html_url":"https://github.com/HolonProduction","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"The old impl would stack allocate lists to store the index of all ancestor up to the root node. This impl avoids that by finding a common ancestor and only comparing the indizes for that ancestor. This also makes the implementation independent of depth in the tree, performance is now only influenced by proximity of the nodes.\r\n\r\n<details>\r\n<summary>Benchmarked using this script</summary>\r\n\r\n```gdscript\r\nfunc _ready() -> void:\r\n\tfor i in [2, 100]:\r\n\t\tbenchmark_balanced(i)\r\n\t\tbenchmark_unbalanced(i, true)\r\n\t\tbenchmark_unbalanced(i, false)\r\n\r\nfunc benchmark_unbalanced(nodes: int, first_deep: bool):\r\n\tvar shallow_node = Node.new()\r\n\tif not first_deep:\r\n\t\tself.add_child(shallow_node)\r\n\tvar deep_node = self\r\n\tfor i in range(nodes - 1):\r\n\t\tvar new = Node.new()\r\n\t\tdeep_node.add_child(new)\r\n\t\tdeep_node = new\r\n\tif first_deep:\r\n\t\tself.add_child(shallow_node)\r\n\t\r\n\tvar t1 = Time.get_ticks_usec()\r\n\tfor i in range(1000):\r\n\t\tshallow_node.is_greater_than(deep_node)\r\n\tvar t2 = Time.get_ticks_usec()\r\n\tprint(\"Unbalanced n=\" + str(nodes) + \" first_deep = \" + str(first_deep))\r\n\tprint(\"\\tshallow > deep: \" + str(t2 - t1))\r\n\t\r\n\tvar t3 = Time.get_ticks_usec()\r\n\tfor i in range(1000):\r\n\t\tdeep_node.is_greater_than(shallow_node)\r\n\tvar t4 = Time.get_ticks_usec()\r\n\tprint(\"\\tdeep > shallow: \" + str(t4 - t3))\r\n\r\nfunc benchmark_balanced(nodes: int):\r\n\tvar left = self\r\n\tvar right = self\r\n\tfor i in range(int(nodes / 2)):\r\n\t\tvar nl = Node.new()\r\n\t\tvar nr = Node.new()\r\n\t\tleft.add_child(nl)\r\n\t\tright.add_child(nr)\r\n\t\tleft = nl\r\n\t\tright = nr\r\n\tvar t1 = Time.get_ticks_usec()\r\n\tfor i in range(1000):\r\n\t\tleft.is_greater_than(right)\r\n\tvar t2 = Time.get_ticks_usec()\r\n\tprint(\"Balanced n=\" + str(nodes) + \": \" + str(t2 - t1))\r\n\tprint(\"\\tfirst > last: \" + str(t2 - t1))\r\n\t\r\n\tvar t3 = Time.get_ticks_usec()\r\n\tfor i in range(1000):\r\n\t\tright.is_greater_than(left)\r\n\tvar t4 = Time.get_ticks_usec()\r\n\tprint(\"\\tlast > first: \" + str(t4 - t3))\r\n```\r\n\r\n</details>\r\n\r\nBenchmarked once with the script attached to a node that was close to the scene tree root and once with the script attached to a node that had a depth of around 50. For the impl from this PR there is no significant difference, for the old impl there is.\r\n\r\nBenchmark:\r\n\r\ndeep | n (proximity) |   | Before (usec) 3 samples | After (usec) 3 samples | %\r\n-- | -- | -- | -- | -- | --\r\nFALSE | 2 | balanced, first > last | 344.33 | 315.00 | 8.52\r\n  |   | balanced, last > first | 346.00 | 315.00 | 8.96\r\n  |   | first deep, shallow > deep | 342.00 | 308.33 | 9.84\r\n  |   | first deep, deep > shallow | 342.67 | 309.67 | 9.63\r\n  |   | last deep, shallow > deep | 344.00 | 312.33 | 9.21\r\n  |   | last deep, deep > shallow | 337.67 | 307.00 | 9.08\r\n  | 100 | balanced, first > last | 811.67 | 386.67 | 52.36\r\n  |   | balanced, last > first | 799.67 | 382.67 | 52.15\r\n  |   | first deep, shallow > deep | 809.67 | 450.67 | 44.34\r\n  |   | first deep, deep > shallow | 811.00 | 445.00 | 45.13\r\n  |   | last deep, shallow > deep | 823.67 | 397.00 | 51.80\r\n  |   | last deep, deep > shallow | 815.00 | 392.00 | 51.90\r\nTRUE | 2 | balanced, first > last | 977.33 | 310.33 | 68.25\r\n  |   | balanced, last > first | 905.33 | 308.00 | 65.98\r\n  |   | first deep, shallow > deep | 904.33 | 308.00 | 65.94\r\n  |   | first deep, deep > shallow | 905.00 | 307.00 | 66.08\r\n  |   | last deep, shallow > deep | 906.67 | 311.33 | 65.66\r\n  |   | last deep, deep > shallow | 918.33 | 311.00 | 66.13\r\n  | 100 | balanced, first > last | 1424.33 | 375.33 | 73.65\r\n  |   | balanced, last > first | 1430.00 | 379.67 | 73.45\r\n  |   | first deep, shallow > deep | 1388.00 | 394.00 | 71.61\r\n  |   | first deep, deep > shallow | 1393.67 | 397.33 | 71.49\r\n  |   | last deep, shallow > deep | 1472.00 | 390.67 | 73.46\r\n  |   | last deep, deep > shallow | 1396.33 | 391.33 | 71.97\r\n","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279097966,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTc5NjY=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:core","name":"topic:core","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":3240950060,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwzMjQwOTUwMDYw","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/performance","name":"performance","description":"","color":"447777","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":12939969,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AxXLB","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/23","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/23","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/23/labels","number":23,"state":"closed","title":"4.6","description":"","creator":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_